{"sections":[{"slug":"拟分离概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拟分离概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟分离概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"拟分离概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">满足如下等价条件的概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">拟分离</span></strong> (quasi-separated) <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的任意两个仿射开集的交均为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟紧概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧概形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对角线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对角线</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_X\\colon X\\to X\\times X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟紧态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧态射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟分离概形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">版本是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟分离态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟分离态射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}